Jev v1.13 dodges rockets with probability calculation 🚀

@typesafeai's new non-LLM model returns decisions instead of text so we had it calculate a safe tile every 330 ms while rockets fell and it survived 25 of 26 for under a cent

Run Jev via API -&gt; https://t.co/RbcCOIgVkj https://t.co/f2VmOEPFnO

